{"event_id":"EVT-000065","timestamp_utc":"2026-08-13T19:52:36.308Z","session_id":"SESSION-BATCH-20260813T191750292904Z","run_id":"RUN-I2-029-20260813T194931207752Z","requirement_id":"I2-029","event_type":"iteration_completed","iteration":3,"static_valid":true,"validator_accept":false,"matcher_activated":false,"decision":"REVISE","feedback":"Revise the conditional model: remove unjustified sh:minCount 1 requirements that force a structural member, calculation case, section modulus, shear area, and generic thickness to exist when the clause only constrains calculations that are performed; validate each supplied calculation/member context instead. Complete the comparison model by adding the supplied nltl:flangeMaterialIncludedInShearArea boolean on its required owner nltl:calculationCase, representing the permitted flange-material alternative without making mutually exclusive alternatives conjunctively mandatory. Make nltl:flangeFitted single-valued (sh:maxCount 1) so simultaneous true and false values cannot select the false branch and bypass required net flange thickness. Ensure the member-specific net-thickness checks are evaluated through the authoritative ship target and canonical hasStructuralMember relationship while preserving the properties on their canonical structuralMember domain, rather than treating the nested member shape as an independent target/owner.","generator_elapsed_ms":42083.35,"validator_elapsed_ms":19343.736}
